---
import Main from "../layouts/Main.astro";
import PageHeader from "../components/PageHeader.astro";
---

<Main title="About - Aurora Nyxus" description="Aurora Nyxus is an independent Canadian AI compute builder. We build the boxes, mesh the capacity, and deploy sovereign on-prem systems. We run our own workloads on our own hardware.">
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="About"
    title="We build the compute we wanted to own"
    lede="Renting cloud inference at thousands a month made no sense when Ontario power is cheap and the hardware can live where you trust it. So we built it. Now we build it for others."
    accent="green"
    bgSrc="/images/hardware/fig-06-bench-build.webp"
    bgAlt="Workstation chassis on a dark build bench"
  />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20 sm:py-28">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium text-ink sm:text-3xl">The origin</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-graphite">
          Customer zero is us. Nightly agentic workflows were costing about
          {"$5,000"} a month on a hyperscaler. We priced a build, ran the math,
          and committed: a multi-GPU node meshed with spare hardware, hosted on
          a fast Canadian connection. The system we built for ourselves is the
          product we now build for you.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-medium text-ink sm:text-3xl">The conviction</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-graphite">
          Compute you depend on should be compute you own, on soil you trust.
          Canada sits low in the global hardware queue, so we are scrappy: we
          mesh old and new hardware into capacity, and we build an Oxide-class
          standard of engineering at workstation and node scale.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <h2 class="font-display mb-10 text-3xl font-medium text-ink">What we stand on</h2>
    <div class="grid gap-px border border-hairline bg-hairline sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="bg-canvas p-7 sm:p-8">
        <p class="mono-label mb-3 text-aurora-green">01</p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-ink">Independent</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite">A founder-owned Canadian venture, not a reseller.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-canvas p-7 sm:p-8">
        <p class="mono-label mb-3 text-signal">02</p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-ink">Engineering-first</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite">Precision builds, stress-tested, documented.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-canvas p-7 sm:p-8">
        <p class="mono-label mb-3 text-aurora-violet">03</p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-ink">Sovereign</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite">Canadian custody and CLOUD-Act-free deployment.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-canvas p-7 sm:p-8">
        <p class="mono-label mb-3 text-aurora-green">04</p>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-medium text-ink">Honest</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite">We show the break-even math and name the tradeoffs.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 pb-24 pt-8 sm:pb-32">
    <p class="text-sm text-graphite">
      Aurora Nyxus partners with
      <a href="https://daicompute.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-aurora-green hover:underline">DAI Compute</a>
      on sovereign infrastructure.
      <a href="/contact" class="text-aurora-green hover:underline">Contact the team</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Main>
